<title>GERMANY: Fedex names new Germany, E.Europe director.</title>
<headline>Fedex names new Germany, E.Europe director.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Express said it has appointed Peter Grimm as managing director sales for Germany and Eastern Europe.</p>
<p>Grimm, who will continue to be responsible for sales in Germany, Eastern Europe and Scandinavia, aimed to increase FedEx's presence in Germany, a company statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;FexEx is the largest express air cargo company worldwide but in Germany is often still seen as a niche carrier,&quot; he said. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom  Tel +44-171-542-7706 Fax +517</p>
</text>
